Typographic corrections
-----------------------
Only docs/fedoryuk_weber_wavefunction_and_energy.md changed.
In all eight displayed coefficients c_-3,R, c_-1,R, c_1,R, c_3,R,
c_-3,I, c_-1,I, c_1,I, c_3,I, accidental commas inside products were
replaced by LaTeX multiplication spacing:

- before: \sqrt2,3^{3/4}; after: \sqrt2\,3^{3/4}
- before: \sqrt2,3^{1/4}; after: \sqrt2\,3^{1/4}

The first form occurred four times in the j=+-3 coefficients and the second
four times in the j=+-1 coefficients.  No sign, factor, coefficient,
equation, scientific claim, asymptotic status, script logic, or test logic
changed.  The documented coefficients agree with the exact verifier output.

